
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#080808">
  <title>Team SIMC</title>

  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      min-height: 100vh;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      color: white;
      background-color: #080808;
      background-image:
        linear-gradient(
          rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45),
          rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.78)
        ),
        url("https://raw.githubusercontent.com/naoBkkk/ZDJ/refs/heads/main/image%20(10).png");
      background-size: cover;
      background-position: center;
      background-attachment: fixed;
      background-repeat: no-repeat;
    }

    main {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 50px 20px;
    }

    .content {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 850px;
      padding: 40px;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.48);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
      border-radius: 16px;
      backdrop-filter: blur(5px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(5px);
      box-shadow: 0 15px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
      animation: appear 1s ease both;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(38px, 8vw, 68px);
      text-align: center;
      letter-spacing: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      text-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
    }

    .subtitle {
      text-align: center;
      color: #aaa;
      font-size: 12px;
      letter-spacing: 5px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 35px;
    }

    .divider {
      width: 65px;
      height: 3px;
      background: white;
      margin: 0 auto 30px;
      border-radius: 5px;
    }

    #message {
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.9;
      color: #e0e0e0;
      white-space: pre-line;
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    }

    .contact {
      margin-top: 30px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .contact a {
      display: inline-block;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
      padding: 13px 24px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45);
      border-radius: 6px;
      transition: background 0.25s, color 0.25s;
    }

    .contact a:hover {
      background: white;
      color: black;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      color: #888;
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 3px;
      margin-top: 35px;
    }

    @keyframes appear {
      from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(18px);
      }
      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      body {
        background-attachment: scroll;
      }

      main {
        padding: 20px 12px;
      }

      .content {
        padding: 28px 20px;
      }

      h1 {
        letter-spacing: 5px;
      }

      .subtitle {
        letter-spacing: 3px;
      }

      #message {
        font-size: 14px;
        line-height: 1.8;
      }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      *, *::before, *::after {
        animation: none !important;
        transition: none !important;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <main>
    <section class="content">
      <h1>SIMC</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Our Story · Our Vision · Our Art</p>
      <div class="divider"></div>

      <p id="message"></p>

      <div class="contact">
        <a id="contactLink"
           href="https://discord.com/"
           target="_blank"
           rel="noopener noreferrer">
          Contact Us on Discord
        </a>
      </div>

      <footer>TEAM SIMC © 2026</footer>
    </section>
  </main>

  <script>
    // EDIT YOUR WEBSITE TEXT HERE
    const myText = `Team SIMC was built through years of struggle and unsuccessful Roblox exploits.

We're trying to become the biggest, but it's difficult when we receive little to no support. We're also working to get rid of skids in our community.

We believe exploiting is an art. It should have meaning, creativity, and a unique style. Some people think that skidding will make them the best, but that isn't true.

We make mistakes, learn from them, and keep improving. We often have only a few people available to help at a time, making it difficult to achieve everything we're working toward.

People dismiss this as kids' stuff, but for us, it's years of hard work. We do it for the satisfaction of the people who understand what we're trying to create.

The real world feels like it's going downhill, just like Roblox's player activity pie chart. Despite everything, we're still pushing forward, trying to become the biggest.

If you're willing to help us on our journey, contact @riprc7 on Discord.`;

    document.getElementById("message").textContent = myText;

    // EDIT YOUR CONTACT LINK HERE
    // Replace this with your Discord invite or profile URL.
    const discordLink = "https://discord.com/";
    document.getElementById("contactLink").href = discordLink;
  </script>
</body>
</html>
